{
  "info": {
    "name": "Coopers To-Do List API",
    "description": "# Coopers To-Do List API\n\nRESTful API for managing personal to-do lists. Supports user registration and login via **JWT stored in an HttpOnly cookie**, full CRUD on to-do items, and a public contact form.\n\n## Base URL\n`http://localhost:3334` (development). Update the `baseUrl` collection variable for other environments.\n\n## Authentication\nProtected routes read the `token` cookie set automatically on login/register. Enable **\"Send cookies\"** in Postman settings. No manual `Authorization` header is required.\n\n## Error shape\nAll error responses share this consistent structure:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"ErrorClassName\",\n  \"action\": \"User-friendly suggestion.\",\n  \"message\": \"Error description.\",\n  \"status_code\": 400,\n  \"fields\": { \"fieldName\": [\"validation message\"] }\n}\n```\n> `fields` is only present on `ValidationError` (HTTP 400).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3334",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL of the API server. Change to your staging or production URL as needed."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Endpoints for user account lifecycle and session management.\n\nAuthentication is cookie-based: a `token` HttpOnly cookie is set on register/login and cleared on logout. All endpoints in the **To-Do** folder require this cookie to be present and valid.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "description": "Creates a new user account and starts a session.\n\n**Auth required:** No\n\n**Password rules:** minimum 8 characters; must contain at least one lowercase letter, one uppercase letter, one digit, and one special character.\n\nOn success the server sets a `token` HttpOnly cookie (Max-Age 3600 s, SameSite=None, Secure in production) and returns the new user's `id` and `name`.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password@123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                { "key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "token=<jwt>; Path=/; Max-Age=3600; HttpOnly; SameSite=None; Secure" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"name\": \"John Doe\"\n  }\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password@123\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Bad Request – Validation Error",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"name\": \"ValidationError\",\n  \"action\": \"Fix the highlighted fields and try again.\",\n  \"message\": \"Invalid input data.\",\n  \"status_code\": 400,\n  \"fields\": {\n    \"email\": [\"Must be a valid email address.\"],\n    \"password\": [\"Must be at least 8 characters.\", \"Must contain at least one uppercase letter.\"]\n  }\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Jo\",\n  \"email\": \"not-an-email\",\n  \"password\": \"weak\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "409 Conflict – Email Already in Use",
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"name\": \"ConflictError\",\n  \"action\": \"Use a different email or sign in.\",\n  \"message\": \"Email already in use.\",\n  \"status_code\": 409\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password@123\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "description": "Authenticates an existing user and starts a session.\n\n**Auth required:** No\n\nOn success the server sets a `token` HttpOnly cookie (Max-Age 3600 s) and returns the user's `id`, `name`, and `email`.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password@123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                { "key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "token=<jwt>; Path=/; Max-Age=3600; HttpOnly; SameSite=None; Secure" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"john@example.com\"\n  }\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password@123\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Bad Request – Validation Error",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"name\": \"ValidationError\",\n  \"action\": \"Fix the highlighted fields and try again.\",\n  \"message\": \"Invalid input data.\",\n  \"status_code\": 400,\n  \"fields\": {\n    \"email\": [\"Must be a valid email address.\"]\n  }\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"not-an-email\",\n  \"password\": \"Password@123\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized – Invalid Credentials",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"name\": \"UnauthorizedError\",\n  \"action\": \"Check your email and password.\",\n  \"message\": \"Invalid credentials.\",\n  \"status_code\": 401\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"WrongPassword@1\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "description": "Ends the current session by clearing the `token` cookie.\n\n**Auth required:** Yes (must have an active `token` cookie)\n\nThe response body confirms the logout; the server instructs the browser to delete the cookie.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
            "header": []
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK – Logged Out",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Logged out successfully.\"\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
                "header": []
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized – Token Not Provided",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"name\": \"UnauthorizedError\",\n  \"action\": \"Sign in to continue.\",\n  \"message\": \"Token not provided.\",\n  \"status_code\": 401\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
                "header": []
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Returns the profile of the currently authenticated user.\n\n**Auth required:** Yes (must have an active `token` cookie)\n\nReturns `id`, `name`, `email`, and `created_at`.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
            "header": []
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK – Current User",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z\"\n  }\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
                "header": []
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized – Token Not Provided",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"name\": \"UnauthorizedError\",\n  \"action\": \"Sign in to continue.\",\n  \"message\": \"Token not provided.\",\n  \"status_code\": 401\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
                "header": []
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized – Invalid or Expired Token",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"name\": \"UnauthorizedError\",\n  \"action\": \"Sign in again.\",\n  \"message\": \"Invalid or expired token.\",\n  \"status_code\": 401\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
                "header": []
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "To-Do",
      "description": "CRUD operations on the authenticated user's to-do list.\n\n**All endpoints require an active `token` cookie.** Make sure you are logged in before calling these routes.\n\nTodos are returned sorted by completion status (`done` ascending), then by `order` ascending, then by creation date ascending.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List todos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Returns all to-do items belonging to the authenticated user.\n\n**Auth required:** Yes\n\nItems are sorted: incomplete items first (`done: false`), then by `order` ascending, then by `created_at` ascending.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/to-do",
            "header": []
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK – Todo List",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"todos\": [\n    { \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\", \"text\": \"Buy groceries\", \"done\": false, \"order\": 0 },\n    { \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901\", \"text\": \"Read a book\", \"done\": false, \"order\": 1 },\n    { \"id\": \"c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012\", \"text\": \"Call dentist\", \"done\": true, \"order\": 2 }\n  ]\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/to-do",
                "header": []
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized – Token Not Provided",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"name\": \"UnauthorizedError\",\n  \"action\": \"Sign in to continue.\",\n  \"message\": \"Token not provided.\",\n  \"status_code\": 401\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/to-do",
                "header": []
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Create todo",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "description": "Creates a new to-do item for the authenticated user.\n\n**Auth required:** Yes\n\nThe `text` field is trimmed before storage; a blank or whitespace-only string is rejected with a 400 error.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/to-do",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"Buy groceries\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created – Todo Created",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"todo\": {\n    \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\",\n    \"text\": \"Buy groceries\",\n    \"done\": false,\n    \"order\": 0\n  }\n}",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/to-do",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"text\": \"Buy groceries\"\n}",
                  "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
